Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 19:01:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 095/154] feat(quit): restyle the hold-to-quit panel in the
 overlay language
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The panel wears the overlay surface, ink, radius and shadow, and renders the shortcut as keycaps. It measured its label with the string width, but an NSTextField cell insets text 2pt a side and wraps by default, so the trailing words were cut and the window was sized too narrow. Measuring the cell fixes both.

Signed-off-by: János Mikó <693558+janosmiko@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 chrome/browser/ui/cocoa/confirm_quit.cc       |   6 +
 .../ui/cocoa/confirm_quit_panel_controller.mm | 314 ++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 262 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)

